Subject: Cantor Embodied Agent Identity And Binding Source

Description: Verbose source selected from the Minecraft embodied-agent architecture intake. It defines the smallest provider-neutral identity and lifecycle boundary needed for many logical Cantor agents to bind, release, suspend, and resume replaceable environment embodiments without yet observing or affecting a game.

